ass=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> inserted</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> await</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> tx.ledger.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">appendIdempotent</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">({</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      accountId: card.ownerAccountId,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      direction: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'CREDIT'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      amountMinor: req.amountMinor,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      currency: card.currency,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      source: { kind: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'GIFT_CARD_REDEEM'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, cardId: card.id },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      idempotencyKey: req.idempotencyKey,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      occurredAt: </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">now</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    });</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (inserted.replayed) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> inserted.result;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    await</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> tx.giftCards.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">update</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(card.id, {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      remainingMinor: card.remainingMinor </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> req.amountMinor,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      status: card.remainingMinor </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> req.amountMinor </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">===</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> ?</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'REDEEMED'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> :</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'PARTIALLY_REDEEMED'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    });</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    await</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> tx.pinFailures.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">clear</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(failKey);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { ok: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, creditedMinor: req.amountMinor };</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  });</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>注意 <code>pinFailures</code> 记录在<strong>卡维度</strong>而不是请求维度：同一张卡的连续失败要累计，这样才能对抗针对单卡的枚举。同时注意<strong>失败计数在成功后清零</strong>——否则用户在多次输错后终于输对，仍然带着失败计数，会在下一次正常操作时被误锁。</p>\n<p><strong>失败计数必须按卡 + 时间窗口双重约束</strong>，且失败计数表的写入也应该在事务内（否则失败记录可能与卡状态不一致）。这里有一个细节：<code>pinFailures</code> 是<strong>唯一一张需要 update/delete 的表</strong>吗？不是——它也应该用追加记录 + 按时间窗口聚合的方式实现，保持全库「只追加」的纪律（见<a href=\"../stored-balance/balance-ledger\">余额账户与只追加流水</a>）。聚合查询比计数列稍慢，但它带来的可重放性在排查「为什么这个用户被锁了」时价值极高。</p>\n<h2 id=\"限速与在线枚举防护\">限速与在线枚举防护</h2><p>限速是卡密安全的<strong>乘法项</strong>：没有它，前面所有哈希与幂等工作白做——攻击者可以一个一个猜卡密，猜中就用幂等键正常兑换。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"interface RateLimitSpec {&#10;  key: string;&#10;  windowSeconds: number;&#10;  maxAttempts: number;&#10;  lockoutSeconds: number;&#10;}&#10;&#10;const REDEEM_LIMITS: RateLimitSpec[] = [&#10;  { key: &#39;ip&#39;, windowSeconds: 3600, maxAttempts: 50, lockoutSeconds: 3600 },&#10;  { key: &#39;account&#39;, windowSeconds: 3600, maxAttempts: 20, lockoutSeconds: 7200 },&#10;  { key: &#39;card&#39;, windowSeconds: 86400, maxAttempts: 5, lockoutSeconds: 86400 },&#10;  { key: &#39;device&#39;, windowSeconds: 3600, maxAttempts: 30, lockoutSeconds: 3600 },&#10;];\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">interface</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> RateLimitSpec</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  key</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  windowSeconds</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  maxAttempts</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  lockoutSeconds</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> REDEEM_LIMITS</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> RateLimitSpec</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> [</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  { key: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'ip'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, windowSeconds: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">3600</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, maxAttempts: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">50</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, lockoutSeconds: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">3600</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  { key: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'account'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, windowSeconds: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">3600</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, maxAttempts: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">20</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, lockoutSeconds: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">7200</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  { key: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'card'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, windowSeconds: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">86400</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, maxAttempts: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">5</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, lockoutSeconds: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">86400</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  { key: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'device'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, windowSeconds: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">3600</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, maxAttempts: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">30</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, lockoutSeconds: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">3600</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">];</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>多维限速是必需的</strong>，因为单维可以被轻易绕过：只限 IP，攻击者换代理；只限账号，攻击者注册新账号；只限卡，攻击者先在多张卡上分散尝试（横向枚举）。四个维度同时约束后，攻击者要么面临成本急剧上升，要么必须同时控制大量 IP、账号与设备，这就落入了第 4 章第 2 篇的购买侧风控视野。</p>\n<p><strong>「卡维度」的锁定必须谨慎</strong>。如果攻击者知道某张卡的卡号，他可以通过反复输错卡密来<strong>故意锁死这张卡</strong>，造成合法持卡人无法兑换（拒绝服务）。缓解办法是把卡维度的锁定做成「延迟而非禁止」——超限后不是永久锁定，而是要求额外的验证途径（原购买账号登录、联系客服、走申诉流程）。<strong>安全性与可用性的这个权衡在卡密场景特别尖锐</strong>，因为卡号本身通常是可见的（印在卡上、在邮件里），攻击者知道卡号的门槛极低。</p>\n<p><strong>枚举攻击的另一个入口是「卡号池未发行的部分」</strong>。第 1 章的<a href=\"../1-gift-card-lifecycle/card-issue-purchase\">卡号生成</a>已经警告过短码空间的问题：如果卡号是 10 位数字且没有校验位设计，攻击者可以猜未发行的卡号，然后试图兑换——此时他甚至不需要正确的卡密，只需要系统对「卡号不存在」与「卡密错误」给出不同响应。<strong>响应必须同构</strong>：卡号不存在与卡密错误都应返回同一个错误码与相近的响应时间，否则攻击者可以先用卡号枚举筛出有效卡号，再集中爆破卡密。这是一个非常容易被忽略的细节，且修复成本极低。</p>\n<h2 id=\"卡密的生命周期与作废\">卡密的生命周期与作废</h2><p>最后是卡密的<strong>退出路径</strong>，这是审计必查项：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"type PinLifecycleEvent =&#10;  | { kind: &#39;ISSUED&#39;; batchId: string }&#10;  | { kind: &#39;DELIVERED&#39;; orderId: string; channel: &#39;email&#39; | &#39;sms&#39; | &#39;print&#39; }&#10;  | { kind: &#39;REVEALED&#39;; accountId: string; ip: string; deviceId: string }&#10;  | { kind: &#39;REDEEMED&#39;; cardId: string }&#10;  | { kind: &#39;VOIDED&#39;; reason: string; operatorId: string }&#10;  | { kind: &#39;ROTATED&#39;; reason: string; newPinDeliveredAt: Date };\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">type</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> PinLifecycleEvent</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  |</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">kind</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'ISSUED'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">batchId</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  |</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">kind</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'DELIVERED'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">orderId</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">channel</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'email'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'sms'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'print'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  |</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">kind</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'REVEALED'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">accountId</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">ip</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">deviceId</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  |</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">kind</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'REDEEMED'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">cardId</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  |</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">kind</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'VOIDED'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">reason</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">operatorId</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  |</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">kind</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'ROTATED'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">reason</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">newPinDeliveredAt</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Date</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> };</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>「查看卡密」是一次必须留痕的动作</strong>（<code>REVEALED</code>）。它是唯一能让持卡人在不兑换的情况下知道卡密的途径，也是账号被盗后攻击者最直接的窃取方式。留痕让「异常查看模式」（同一账号短时间查看大量卡密）可被监测，与第 4 章第 2 篇的交付侧防线配合。</p>\n<p><strong>卡密作废（<code>VOIDED</code>）与卡密轮换（<code>ROTATED</code>）是两种不同的处置</strong>。作废让卡的价值消失（用于确认泄露且价值未兑付的批次），轮换保留价值但换一个卡密（用于「卡密可能泄露但用户还在」的场景）。<strong>轮换必须保证旧卡密立即失效</strong>，且新卡密通过可信渠道重新交付——这个流程本身就是一个完整的发行流程，不能简化。</p>\n<p><strong>批量作废必须按 <code>batchId</code> 执行且可审计</strong>，这是第 1 章批次设计的最终消费点：从「发现问题」到「止损」之间应该是分钟级的，而不是需要逐张处理。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>卡密长度不够，安全靠三约束</strong>：不可枚举（限速）、不可离线破解（加盐哈希 + pepper）、不可重放（唯一约束 + 状态机）。</li>\n<li><strong>salt 存库防彩虹表，pepper 不存库防拖库后离线破解</strong>，两者不可互相替代；哈希比较必须用 <code>timingSafeEqual</code>。</li>\n<li><strong>卡密查询用确定性查找键</strong> <code>HMAC(&quot;${cardId}:${pin}&quot;, pepper)</code>，而非对卡密建索引。</li>\n<li><strong>兑换幂等靠三层</strong>：状态机（表达业务约束）、行锁（串行化并发）、唯一约束（最后硬保证），三层都在同一事务内且缺一不可。</li>\n<li><strong>限速是乘法项，必须多维</strong>（IP / 账号 / 卡 / 设备），单维可被绕过；卡维度锁定要用延迟而非禁止，因为卡号往往可见，永久锁定可被用来做拒绝服务。</li>\n<li><strong>「卡号不存在」与「卡密错误」的响应必须同构</strong>，否则攻击者可先枚举卡号再爆破卡密；这是低成本高收益的细节。</li>\n<li><strong>卡密生命周期需完整留痕</strong>，查看卡密必须审计（<code>REVEALED</code>）；作废与轮换是不同处置，批量作废按 <code>batchId</code> 执行——这是第 1 章批次设计的最终消费点。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>至此本 hub 的四条主线闭环：卡从发行到核销（第 1 章）、余额的记账与流转（第 2 章）、价值的合规退出（第 3 章）、以及不依赖判断的硬约束（第 4 章）。四条线共享同一份地基——<a href=\"../stored-balance/balance-ledger\">只追加流水</a>——这也是本 hub 唯一一处所有章节都必须复用的模型。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"卡密安全与兑换幂等","id":"卡密安全与兑换幂等"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：卡密是一种低熵秘密","id":"核心概念-卡密是一种低熵秘密"},{"level":2,"text":"卡密存储：哈希方案的选择","id":"卡密存储-哈希方案的选择"},{"level":2,"text":"兑换幂等：三层保证","id":"兑换幂等-三层保证"},{"level":2,"text":"限速与在线枚举防护","id":"限速与在线枚举防护"},{"level":2,"text":"卡密的生命周期与作废","id":"卡密的生命周期与作废"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"盗刷买卡/卡密欺诈防护","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/gift-card-stored-value/aml-fraud/gift-card-fraud"},"next":null}